{
  "mcp_servers": [
    {
      "id": "official-filesystem-workspace",
      "name": "MCP Filesystem（官方 @modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem，需 Node/npx）",
      "command": "npx",
      "args": [
        "-y",
        "@modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem",
        "__JACHIN_WORKSPACE__"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "official-mcp-fetch",
      "name": "MCP Fetch（官方 mcp-server-fetch，单 URL 抓正文）",
      "command": "__JACHIN_MCP_PYTHON__",
      "args": ["-m", "mcp_server_fetch"],
      "env": {
        "PYTHONIOENCODING": "utf-8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tavily-search",
      "name": "Tavily Search（联网检索，官方 MCP）",
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "tavily-mcp@latest"],
      "env": {
        "TAVILY_API_KEY": "${TAVILY_API_KEY}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "maps_assistant",
      "name": "Google Maps MCP（地理编码、路线、周边地点；npm @modelcontextprotocol/server-google-maps）",
      "command": "npx",
      "args": [
        "-y",
        "@modelcontextprotocol/server-google-maps"
      ],
      "env": {
        "GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY": "${GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "com.jachin.mcp.office_powerpoint",
      "name": "Jachin Office PowerPoint MCP（PPTX，可选）",
      "command": "python",
      "args": ["-m", "ppt_mcp_server"],
      "env": {
        "PPT_TEMPLATE_PATH": "__JACHIN_WORKSPACE__/ppt_templates"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sqlite_manager",
      "name": "SQLite 生活库 / 记账（PyPI mcp-server-sqlite，需 uv/uvx）",
      "command": "uvx",
      "args": [
        "mcp-server-sqlite",
        "--db-path",
        "__JACHIN_WORKSPACE__/my_life_data.db"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "bilibili-mcp",
      "name": "Bilibili（@xzxzzx/bilibili-mcp · CC 字幕/高赞评论；Win 若裸 npx 失败见 _comment）",
      "command": "npx",
      "args": [
        "-y",
        "@xzxzzx/bilibili-mcp"
      ],
      "env": {
        "BILIBILI_SESSDATA": "${BILIBILI_SESSDATA}",
        "BILIBILI_BILI_JCT": "${BILIBILI_BILI_JCT}",
        "BILIBILI_DEDEUSERID": "${BILIBILI_DEDEUSERID}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "jachin-puppeteer-cdp",
      "name": "Puppeteer MCP（Jachin CDP 附加版 · connect 远程调试 Chrome，不 launch 第二套 Chromium）",
      "command": "node",
      "args": [
        "__JACHIN_REPO_ROOT__/tools/mcp-jachin-puppeteer-cdp/index.mjs"
      ],
      "env": {
        "PUPPETEER_BROWSER_URL": "${KALAROKO_CDP_ENDPOINT}",
        "ALLOW_DANGEROUS": "true",
        "HTTP_PROXY": "${HTTP_PROXY}",
        "HTTPS_PROXY": "${HTTPS_PROXY}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "browser-use",
      "name": "Browser-Use（Agent 级浏览器自动化 MCP · LLM 意图驱动 · https://github.com/browser-use/browser-use）",
      "command": "uvx",
      "args": [
        "--from",
        "browser-use[cli]",
        "browser-use",
        "--mcp"
      ],
      "env": {
        "PYTHONIOENCODING": "utf-8",
        "OPENAI_API_KEY": "${OPENAI_API_KEY}",
        "ANTHROPIC_API_KEY": "${ANTHROPIC_API_KEY}",
        "BROWSER_USE_HEADLESS": "${BROWSER_USE_HEADLESS}",
        "BROWSER_USE_CONFIG_PATH": "${BROWSER_USE_CONFIG_PATH}",
        "HTTP_PROXY": "${HTTP_PROXY}",
        "HTTPS_PROXY": "${HTTPS_PROXY}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "notion-remote-oauth",
      "name": "Notion 托管 MCP（Remote，OAuth；npm mcp-remote → https://mcp.notion.com/mcp）",
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "mcp-remote", "https://mcp.notion.com/mcp"],
      "auto_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "mcp-pyautogui-server",
      "name": "桌面物理自动化（PyAutoGUI MCP：截屏/图像定位/键鼠；Canvas 无 DOM 场景）",
      "command": "uvx",
      "args": ["mcp-pyautogui-server"],
      "env": {
        "PYTHONIOENCODING": "utf-8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "kalaroko_monitor",
      "name": "Kalaroko Web 性能监控（Playwright + httpx；仓库内 l3_client/local_mcps/kalaroko_monitor）",
      "command": "__JACHIN_MCP_PYTHON__",
      "args": [
        "-m",
        "l3_client.local_mcps.kalaroko_monitor.mcp_kalaroko_monitor"
      ],
      "env": {
        "PYTHONIOENCODING": "utf-8",
        "KALAROKO_MONITOR_ALLOWED_HOSTS": "kalaroko.com,www.kalaroko.com,gwp.heronpro.xin",
        "KALAROKO_PERF_HISTORY_PATH": "__JACHIN_WORKSPACE__/kalaroko_perf/history.jsonl"
      }
    }
  ],
  "_comment": "复制到 ~/.jachin/mcp_servers.json 并与仓库 tools/mcp-official/mcp_servers.jachin.example.json 按需合并。**浏览器栈（推荐）**：主轨 **jachin-puppeteer-cdp**（`PUPPETEER_BROWSER_URL` 建议 `${KALAROKO_CDP_ENDPOINT}`，与 Kalaroko E2E / `core/mcp_embedded_runtime` 同源）；辅轨 **browser-use**（`BROWSER_USE_CONFIG_PATH` → 含 `cdp_url` 的 JSON，如 `scripts/run_k11_p1_modules_l3.py` 所写）。**勿**再启用 npm `@modelcontextprotocol/server-puppeteer`：会 `launch` 独立 Chromium，与「只验收远程调试里那一扇 Chrome」冲突，并增加模型选轨熵；历史配置若含该项请删除。`tools/mcp-jachin-puppeteer-cdp` 目录需 `npm install`（纯 CDP 可 `PUPPETEER_SKIP_DOWNLOAD=true`）。**browser-use**：开源 Agent 级浏览器 MCP（PyPI `browser-use[cli]`），官方启动 `uvx --from 'browser-use[cli]' browser-use --mcp`；需本机 `uv`/`uvx`（`pip install uv`）与 Chrome/Chromium；至少配置 **OPENAI_API_KEY** 或 **ANTHROPIC_API_KEY**（见 .env `${...}` 展开）。工具含 `retry_with_browser_use_agent`、`browser_navigate`、`browser_click`、`browser_get_state`、`browser_extract_content` 等（以 tools/list 为准）。调试可设 `BROWSER_USE_LOGGING_LEVEL=DEBUG`；有界面调试设 `BROWSER_USE_HEADLESS=false`。**附加本机已开 Chrome（--remote-debugging-port）**：在 env 中设 `BROWSER_USE_CONFIG_PATH` 指向含 `cdp_url` 的 browser-use 配置 JSON（示例由 `python scripts/run_k11_p1_modules_l3.py` 写入 `~/.jachin/runtime/browser-use-attach-cdp.json`），或加 `--apply-mcp-browser-use-cdp` 合并进 `~/.jachin/mcp_servers.json` 后**重启 L3**；否则 MCP 可能默认再启动独立浏览器。操作顺序建议：先用 **jachin-puppeteer-cdp** 做确定性 `puppeteer_*`；**browser-use** 作 Agent 辅轨（遮挡/多步/重试）。Windows 若 `uvx` 不在 PATH：将 `command` 改为 `uvx` 的绝对路径，或改用 `__JACHIN_MCP_PYTHON__` + `args`: [\"-m\",\"uv\",\"tool\",\"run\",\"--from\",\"browser-use[cli]\",\"browser-use\",\"--mcp\"]。bilibili-mcp：npm @xzxzzx/bilibili-mcp（工具 get_video_info / get_video_comments → mcp:get_*）；**必须**在 .env 配置 BILIBILI_SESSDATA / BILIBILI_BILI_JCT / BILIBILI_DEDEUSERID（对应浏览器 Cookie：SESSDATA、bili_jct、DedeUserID），并在本条 env 用 ${...} 注入，否则字幕/评论会报 Cookie 失效。**Windows** 若裸 npx 启动失败：将 command 改为 cmd.exe，args 改为 [\"/c\",\"npx\",\"-y\",\"@xzxzzx/bilibili-mcp\"]。若需 YouTube 字幕请自行添加 jkawamoto mcp-youtube-transcript（见文档），**不再**由 core/mcp_json_repair 自动注入。代理：.env 设 HTTP_PROXY/HTTPS_PROXY。若仍保留旧版 npx @kimtaeyoon83 YouTube 条目，建议删除以免失败。Fetch 项：官方在 PyPI（pip install mcp-server-fetch），勿使用不存在的 npm 包 @modelcontextprotocol/server-fetch；默认遵守 robots.txt（如头条 /trending/ 会被拒）。需自担合规风险时可在 args 末尾加 \"--ignore-robots-txt\"，或设环境变量 JACHIN_MCP_FETCH_IGNORE_ROBOTS=1 由启动逻辑自动追加（见 core/mcp_json_repair.py）。Filesystem：__JACHIN_WORKSPACE__ 展开为 ~/.jachin/workspace。${TAVILY_API_KEY} / ${GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY} 从 .env 注入，勿把真实 Key 写入 Git。maps_assistant：见 modelcontextprotocol/servers-archived/src/google-maps（NPM @modelcontextprotocol/server-google-maps）。PowerPoint 需 pip install office-powerpoint-mcp-server。sqlite_manager：PyPI mcp-server-sqlite，需 uvx。notion-remote-oauth：Notion 官方托管 Remote MCP（OAuth），npm mcp-remote 桥接 https://mcp.notion.com/mcp；**默认 auto_start false**（避免 L3 自启时打开 Notion OAuth 页）。需要时改 true；或 .env 设 JACHIN_MCP_SKIP_IDS=notion-remote-oauth。详见 docs/MCP_SPEC.md §3.5。**mcp-pyautogui-server**：PyPI 已核验（`pip index versions mcp-pyautogui-server`），物理层截屏+键鼠+图像查找，替代失效的 v88/desktop-controller；需 `pip install uv` 后 `uvx`，或 `pip install mcp-pyautogui-server` 且将 command 改为 `__JACHIN_MCP_PYTHON__`、`args` 改为 `[\"-m\",\"mcp_pyautogui_server\"]`。Linux 无图形会话时可在本条 `env` 增加 `DISPLAY`（如 `:0`）。**kalaroko_monitor**：见上方独立条目；stdio 入口 `l3_client.local_mcps.kalaroko_monitor.mcp_kalaroko_monitor`；验证 `python scripts/test_kalaroko_monitor_mcp_stdio.py`。**jachin-puppeteer-cdp**：见清单内条目；`PUPPETEER_BROWSER_URL` 与 `KALAROKO_CDP_ENDPOINT` 对齐；宿主 `core/mcp_embedded_runtime` 可在占位展开为空时从环境或 `browser-use-attach-cdp.json` 回填。"
}
